Read metadata requests from stdin using session protocol v1

Usage: imageinfo session read [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --help             Show help for this command
      --version          Show version after validating arguments
      --output <output>  Result format (help always uses plain text) [possible values: text, json]
      --color <color>    Presentation preference; foundation output is plain text [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --no-interactive   Keep this invocation noninteractive
      --interactive      Request guided mode (not implemented yet)

Uses fixed v1 JSONL on stdout; omit --output. Reads Unicode token arrays sequentially with request-local settings. No queue, cancellation, metadata writes or elapsed-time guarantee.
